<div id="text_01" class="mktoText"> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Welcome to the launch of our first healthcare newsletter!&nbsp;</span></p> 
<p><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">August was a busy month for us and we wanted to create a one-stop resource for you to stay on top of all the awesome things developing at Flywire. So read on!</span></p> 
<p><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><br /></p> 
